lish\n\nMore soon!\n\nIf you have any suggestions or want to add your favorite animation, just simply join to our discord community. But you can also suggest through the script, we've added a function for that so we can know/be informed if users have requests or new animation idea.\n\nJoining to our discord community will be a big big support for us. Thank you!","tags":["FREE","ANIMATION","ANIMATION CHANGER","LIQUID HUB","OP"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/jYkbeWtYsf","keyLink":"https://jnkie.com/","owner":{"_id":"6857703db7b9c360a6711a44","username":"liquid_official","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aa1190f12e98c95cd413f8a7ece77e66fae1048b37e96a16d1092a7dd6cf59f8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6857703db7b9c360a6711a44-1780938018242.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6857703db7b9c360a6711a44","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aa1190f12e98c95cd413f8a7ece77e66fae1048b37e96a16d1092a7dd6cf59f8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6857703db7b9c360a6711a44-1780938018242.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T02:32:35.644Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a68782df8ec328895c82171","editBy":{"_id":"6857703db7b9c360a6711a44","username":"liquid_official","status":"offline","id":"6857703db7b9c360a6711a44"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-28T09:36:45.014Z"}],"comments":[]}